{"time": 1754760357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2120558151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你还真是把这当你家了”*把人从椅子上拎开“让开，我要用这位置”"}
{"time": 1754760376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1007424448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(到陌生环境不先调查就跟不搜查阶段直接班级审判一样)"}
{"time": 1754760401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1608542591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“爸爸妈妈，我都答应留这了，可以帮治疗一下我的朋友吗..”心里感觉有点恶心，但看到露莉亚虚弱的样子还是说了出来"}
{"time": 1754760423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1315569339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1007424448]（主要是）"}
