{"time": 1754925930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123486092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以帮帮我的师父吗..”指着那个碎片"}
{"time": 1754925950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "330222979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我嘞个自说自话）"}
{"time": 1754926122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2067691155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1507322649]\"唉。\"卡珊德拉一副心痛的表情，抢过剩下装着血晶的罐子，\"被你浪费了好多，剩下这些就当是我透露你情报的交换了。\"她的话理直气壮，心安理得"}
{"time": 1754926187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1069875979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2123486092]（什么碎片）"}
{"time": 1754926199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "580033391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2123486092]除了那个碎片之外，你看见很多碎片里都有佩戴着你熟悉的红色闪电标志的人在和什么东西战斗，当然，你也看见了阿尔贝尔，但是他速度太快，你的肉眼几乎跟不上。不过，这种问题，她显然也不会回答"}
{"time": 1754926214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "511262111", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=68511683]（）"}
{"time": 1754926274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1057232250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“成为你的家人可以把大家放出来吗....”"}
{"time": 1754926547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1333956007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...?\"她带着笑走到你面前，伸出手拉着你的手，语气愉快，\"极好极佳-\""}
{"time": 1754926626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1525274628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...如果你把大家都放了...我就答应你当你的家人...”"}
{"time": 1754926718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "826068762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2067691155]“……有那么好吃么”看着她把余下的收走，索性把边角料规整规整，留着以后做修理素材用“我原本还以为是什么，到最后，其实和金属没什么区别嘛”"}
{"time": 1754926934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "642118516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=826068762]\"不同的龙血性质不同，白龙小姐的比较适合做这个。\"你手里暗红色的匕首寒光凛凛寒气四溢，她打量着，\"现在小伊芙有武器了，要杀了我吗？\"张开双手调笑地看着你"}
{"time": 1754927095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1288948157", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1525274628]她的手有些冰冷，并非生理上，而是从心理上，紫色的蛇吐着信子从她的身上缠到了你的脚踝，\"唔...为什么?大家都做我的家人不就好了?\""}
{"time": 1754927593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1831648222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（刚出狼穴，又入虎口）"}
{"time": 1754927934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1422063061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那你为什么不把大家都叫过来...”"}
{"time": 1754927957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "492157471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=642118516]“不是不可以试试”*在手里把玩着，但是连转刀都转不明白"}
{"time": 1754927980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1005258210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“阿尔贝尔大叔人很好的....你跟他好好说说，大家都会接纳你的...”"}
{"time": 1754928273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1780872599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=492157471]\"虽然很遗憾，但姐姐只能在这里退场了呢...\"语气遗憾，似乎是真的惋惜，闭上了眼。"}
{"time": 1754928333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1429407022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1005258210]\"...不重要。\"她选择性忽视了你的话，\"你的决定呢?人类。\"紫色的蛇攀上你的后背，最后停在了你的脖子上，胸口的血洞还在缓缓滴血"}
{"time": 1754928375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1053456865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“如果我拒绝的话，这只..额..龙就会立刻咬死我，对吗”"}
{"time": 1754928425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1383333006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1053456865]\"龙先生怎么会那么暴力?\"她咯咯笑，捂着嘴看上去满面春风，\"我会放了你哦?\""}
{"time": 1754928497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "974472660", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那成为你的家人要一辈子和你待在一起？”"}
{"time": 1754928634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2043969579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1780872599]“……”*收起匕首，开始琢磨怎么藏在袖子里“没意思，下次真想被捅能不能换张脸”"}
{"time": 1754928879, "type": "recv", "message_id": "180197569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=974472660]\"嗯。\"点头，\"和我在一起有什么不满吗？\""}
{"time": 1754928922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1985521163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我还有事情要做....我的家人被人杀了，我要找她去报仇...”"}
{"time": 1754928986, "type": "recv", "message_id": "377458679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2043969579]\"小伊芙对我是下不去手的啦，我笃定如此。\"她满意地带着手里的罐子准备推门离开，突然停在了门口，回头看向你，勾了勾嘴角，\"你的小情人好像过来了，要怎么做?\""}
{"time": 1754929292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1221291968", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1985521163]\"那种事情，比起成为我的家人还重要吗？\"她的指尖点在下巴上，一脸可爱地看着你，翠绿的瞳孔闪着光"}
{"time": 1754929576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "847648980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“......”有些生气，捏紧了拳头"}
{"time": 1754929804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1966280293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(然后呢)"}
{"time": 1754929806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1707644866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=377458679]“干嘛，该怎么样怎么样”说到这里顿了顿“是不是该准备个隐形眼镜”"}
{"time": 1754929930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "844675357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=847648980](然后呢)"}
{"time": 1754929951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1439756364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“很重要......”"}
{"time": 1754929984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1779574566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“家人不是很重要对的存在吗......还是对你而言只是无所谓的东西..”"}
{"time": 1754930029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1791096719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1707644866]\"我在这里也无所谓?\"她对着你眨眨眼睛，\"昨晚还睡在一起，甚至交换了眼睛，你的小情人不会生气吗？\""}
